				"DCC3LDYN@S. Cinematic ultra-wide shot with extreme environmental scale, a solitary human figure draped in flowing robes stands in open grassland foreground, dwarfed by monumental Chinese palace architecture suspended against towering vertical cliffs. Massive upturned tiled roofs and red columns cascade along the rock face, enveloped in atmospheric mist and intersected by colossal waterfalls plunging from dizzying heights. Architectural repetition, layered depth, and dramatic scale contrast emphasize the surreal realism of the scene. Volumetric lighting diffuses through dense fog and atmospheric haze, softening the distant cityscape below. The composition utilizes deep spatial geometry, with negative space in the meadow foreground amplifying the overwhelming verticality and liminal isolation of the hanging palatial structures, rooted in classical East Asian design language."
